accTitle: Repair the unreachable guest offline
accDescr: After checking eligibility, Automation stops and backs up the instance, uses a helper to repair its root volume, and restarts and verifies the instance.
M["Monitoring identifies unreachable guest"] --> E{"Runbook eligibility and permissions verified?"}
E -->|No| X["Escalate for another recovery path"]
E -->|Yes| S["Stop instance and create backup AMI"]
S --> H["Attach root volume to helper"]
H --> R["Run offline EC2Rescue checks and repairs"]
R --> A["Restore volume and start instance"]
A --> V["Verify access and review rescue output"]
class M inputData
class E decision
class X warning
